{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17539","headline":"句 · 权德舆","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耒水波纹细，湘江竹叶轻。\n古时楼上清明夜，月照楼前撩乱花。\n今日成阴复成子，可怜春尽未归家。\n新妇矶头云半歛，女儿滩畔月初明。\n回合千峰里，晴光似画图。\n征车随反照，候吏暎白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}